  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Atypical by Oversee 30A | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br> <br>Atypical is a great description of this magnificent gulf-front home, with stunning views of the beach and a portion of Western Lake, one of Walton County’s rare coastal dune lakes.<br> <br>Highlights:<br>📍 Grayton Beach!<br>🏖️ Beachfront, next to Grayton Dunes Beach Access!<br>☀️ Panoramic views of the Gulf of Mexico.<br>🛏️ 6 bedrooms, 6 baths, 2 half-baths<br>🪞 Stunning interiors!<br>🍿 Cool media room<br>🚲 5 bikes<br>🔥 Gas grill<br> <br>Perfect for large families or groups, the remarkable house is a sleek, chic, feast for the eyes. It’s also warm and inviting, each room a charming display of modern aesthetics.<br> <br>The first level accommodates 13 guests with 5 bedrooms, including a primary suite, king, with a soaking tub and private patio. A guest room, queen, and a second guest room, queen, each have a private bath. A third guest room has a pair of twin bunk beds, while a fourth has bunks and a twin.<br> <br>Down the hall, cheer for your favorite team in the media room with stadium seating. Or have the kids watch their favorite movie. Upstairs, a primary suite, king, has a soaking tub and an incredible walk-in shower. The second level also hosts the kitchen and living area, with panoramic views of the Gulf of Mexico.<br> <br>The wonderful kitchen is a chef’s dream with high-end appliances including built-in, under-the-counter, Sub-Zero refrigerators and freezers. The two dishwashers can assist with cleanup.<br> <br>Welcome! Our dedicated team at Oversee 30A, a local company, is committed to ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. We strive for perfection and are just a stone's throw away should you require any assistance. Reach out to us anytime, seven days a week, with the added peace of a 24/7 emergency line.<br> <br>Overview:<br>- On the beach (Grayton Dunes Access)<br>- 6 bedrooms, 6 baths, 2 half-baths<br>- 3959 sq ft<br>- On-site parking is limited to 2 vehicles<br>- Additional public parking is available but not guaranteed<br>- Wi-Fi<br>- Gas grill<br>- 5 bikes included<br> <br>Overnight:<br>- King in 1st floor primary; bath; TV<br>- Queen in 1st floor guest room; bath; TV<br>- Queen in 1st floor guest room; bath; TV<br>- 2 twin bunks in 1st floor guest room; bath; TV<br>- Twin bunk and twin in 1st floor guest room; shared hall bath; TV<br>- King in 2nd floor primary; bath; TV<br> <br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
